1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 8)

2
00:00:12,599 --> 00:00:13,599
Chen Wan.

3
00:00:15,359 --> 00:00:17,039
My firefly flew away.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,960
Your insect collection

5
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:24,800
must be fascinating, Mr. Zhao.

6
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,039
That was back when I was a kid.

7
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,439
It's all been burned to ashes now.

8
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:46,439
Mr. Zhao,

9
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:50,079
see you tomorrow.

10
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:52,479
Chen Wan.

11
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:19,760
A leaf fell into your shirt.

12
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,640
Give it to me.

13
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,799
Good night, Mr. Zhao.

14
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,920
Good night.

15
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:17,158
Come on, what's the deal?

16
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:18,839
We're out, and you're
glued to your phone again.

17
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,879
I'm working.

18
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,638
Work, work, work.

19
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:22,959
It's the weekend.

20
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,918
What kind of slave driver is Zhao Shengge,

21
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:26,679
not even letting people
rest on the weekend?

22
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,759
I'm the one hounding him

23
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,680
about work.

24
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:32,759
Hold on, let me reply to a text.

25
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,438
If you still don't feel well,

26
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:50,520
remember to call me.

27
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:08,318
I just sent you a payment breakdown.

28
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,199
Take a look.

29
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,199
Okay.

30
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,719
Speaking of which,

31
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:16,879
Chen Wan actually prepared
this report in advance.

32
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:18,439
He said

33
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:21,239
he has to run to the stock
exchange the next couple of days

34
00:03:21,639 --> 00:03:23,399
and was worried he
wouldn't make it in time.

35
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,400
I've noticed

36
00:03:25,401 --> 00:03:27,561
he's always willing to keep
me posted on his schedule.

37
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,080
Take a look at this.

38
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:50,199
Why was the line always busy
when I called you last time?

39
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,680
I couldn't get through for a whole hour.

40
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:55,000
There was a lot to discuss.

41
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,360
I was swamped.

42
00:03:57,159 --> 00:03:58,159
All right.

43
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:01,479
I'll down three drinks
to make it up to you.

44
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,719
No matter how busy
you are, this isn't right.

45
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,280
You're working yourself to the bone.

46
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,480
Is the money even going into your pocket?

47
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,840
Zhao Shengge really knows
how to bleed people dry.

48
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,840
When was this taken?

49
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:16,759
Who's there?

50
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:17,759
Right now.

51
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:19,399
Zhuo Zhixuan brought him out.

52
00:04:19,759 --> 00:04:20,799
Didn't he keep you posted?

53
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,040
Hanging up.

54
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,518
Well, Look who it is, Mr. Zhao.

55
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,680
No progress from you today?

56
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,039
You don't read it anyway.

57
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,638
As for today's mind map,

58
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,518
I already discussed it
privately with Chen Wan.

59
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,919
We decided to make a simplified version.

60
00:04:38,943 --> 00:04:39,662
Send it to the group chat.

61
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,040
It won't be ready that fast.

62
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:43,279
No need to simplify
it, just send the original.

63
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:44,479
Can you even understand it?

64
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,800
I can try.

65
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:47,198
I'm in the middle of an
experiment right now.

66
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,879
I won't be free until after 1:00 a.m.

67
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,040
I have a meeting tomorrow.

68
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,438
I hope to see it in the
group chat in ten minutes.

69
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,439
Thanks.

70
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:53,920
Hello?

71
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,920
Zhao...

72
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,160
Let me tell you,

73
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:58,638
if Monica hadn't said you've been

74
00:04:58,639 --> 00:05:01,119
showing up to your appointments
on time and doing well lately,

75
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:03,639
I'd be egging Tan Youming
on to go after Zhao Shengge.

76
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,480
Don't worry.

77
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:09,759
Zhao Shengge is the
best client I've ever met.

78
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:13,239
I don't have to put on a
fake smile to kiss up to him,

79
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,680
or drink myself into a stomach ulcer.

80
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:19,879
And there's no cutthroat
competition, either.

81
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,120
Hey.

82
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,600
Believe it or not,

83
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:25,120
he doesn't even let me work overtime.

84
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:31,079
Having a secret crush on a capitalist.

85
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,120
Chen Wan,

86
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,640
you definitely have a
masochistic streak in you.

87
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,120
Xuan,

88
00:05:40,121 --> 00:05:41,878
come over here and have a drink.

89
00:05:41,902 --> 00:05:42,503
Coming.

90
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,066
Come on.

91
00:05:43,176 --> 00:05:44,530
[Mind Map]

92
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,480
Join us.

93
00:05:46,959 --> 00:05:48,318
I'll pass. You go ahead.

94
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,879
I still have some work to take care of.

95
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:52,920
Yeah.

96
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,079
What a coincidence.

97
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,240
Hello,

98
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,199
Mr. Zhao.

99
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,319
Chen Wan.

100
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,278
Mr. Zhao, did you want to talk about

101
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:04,560
the proposal Dr. Fang
sent to the group chat?

102
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:06,399
Are you out?

103
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,279
Yes, I am.

104
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:09,920
Is it too noisy for you?

105
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,518
I'm not busy right now.

106
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:13,800
We can discuss it.

107
00:06:14,199 --> 00:06:16,359
I just finished reviewing the
3D diagrams this afternoon.

108
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,480
Is this a good time for you?

109
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,279
Y-Yes, it is.

110
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:21,040
If it's a bad time, we can talk later.

111
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,079
It's fine.

112
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:23,920
It's a good time.

113
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,600
Work comes first.

114
00:06:24,601 --> 00:06:26,040
Dr. Fang even told me today...

115
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,759
Mr. Zhao, what's wrong?

116
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,079
I'm fine.

117
00:06:32,959 --> 00:06:34,360
Mr. Zhao, your health comes first.

118
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,719
Why don't you get some rest first?

119
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,639
I'll put a report together
as soon as possible.

120
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:39,079
It's okay. I'm fine.

121
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,159
Have you taken your temperature?

122
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,000
Did you take any medicine?

123
00:06:42,001 --> 00:06:43,159
It's flu season, and a lot
of people are getting sick.

124
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,239
So many people are down with it.

125
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,400
You really should be careful.

126
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,680
If you don't take care of a cold early on,

127
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,439
it'll drag out and be hard to shake off.

128
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,519
Is that so?

129
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:51,560
Yes.

130
00:06:51,561 --> 00:06:53,199
How are you feeling right now?

131
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,199
I...

132
00:06:54,439 --> 00:06:55,559
think I have a slight fever.

133
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:56,959
And a sore throat.

134
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,280
Take your temperature first.

135
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,559
If it's too high,

136
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,000
you'll need to take a fever reducer.

137
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,840
You should have some
basic medicine at home, right?

138
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,480
This medicine seems to be expired.

139
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,959
It's fine, let's handle work first.

140
00:07:09,759 --> 00:07:11,959
Why don't you have your
driver bring you some medicine?

141
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,600
He called in sick.

142
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,959
Then...

143
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,879
Then I...

144
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,039
Mr. Chen, hurry over!

145
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,600
They're bringing out the depth charges!

146
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,159
Hurry up, Chen Wan!

147
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,239
We're waiting for you!

148
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,336
You guys go ahead and have fun.

149
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,120
Don't mind me.

150
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,576
I have something to take care of.

151
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,279
Mr. Zhao.

152
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,815
Get back to what you're doing, then.

153
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,839
I won't keep you.

154
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,720
I...

155
00:08:01,136 --> 00:08:03,263
I'll send you some medicine.

156
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,680
Mr. Zhao,

157
00:08:30,681 --> 00:08:32,878
do you need me to call the family
doctor to come check on you?

158
00:08:32,879 --> 00:08:33,879
No need.

159
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:48,398
Mom, Dad, please beg Grandpa for me.

160
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,919
Don't burn them!

161
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,319
The heir to the Zhao family

162
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:54,158
is not allowed to have personal passions.

163
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:58,119
Grandpa, please spare Bozhu!

164
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,320
Get rid of it.

165
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,000
No!

166
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:03,080
Right in front of him.

167
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Forget it.

168
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,000
Haven't I been used
to this for a long time?

169
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,399
Nothing ever truly belongs to me.

170
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:17,039
If it doesn't belong to me,

171
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,080
what's the point of holding on to it?

172
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:25,080
Cheers! Down the hatch!

173
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,320
Cheers!

174
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:28,360
Come on.

175
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,039
Cheers again!

176
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,039
Can't take any more?

177
00:09:33,679 --> 00:09:34,679
Wan,

178
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,800
I'm tapped out. Drink some for me.

179
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,398
Hold on.

180
00:09:40,399 --> 00:09:41,399
Why did he leave?

181
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,800
Why did you run off over here?

182
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,080
I'm fine.

183
00:09:52,759 --> 00:09:53,759
Spill it.

184
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:56,279
Xuan,

185
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,720
all I wanted

186
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,759
was to treat him well.

187
00:10:01,639 --> 00:10:02,919
What happened?

188
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,319
Zhao Shengge is sick.

189
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,840
I wanted to bring him medicine,

190
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,320
but I didn't go.

191
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:13,120
Because it's not my place,

192
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,839
and I was afraid he'd
suspect I had ulterior motives.

193
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,200
He already had a fever,

194
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:20,360
and he didn't seem too
happy toward the end.

195
00:10:21,759 --> 00:10:23,638
That's just how Zhao Shengge is.

196
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:25,320
It's totally normal not to get him.

197
00:10:26,799 --> 00:10:27,799
Xuan,

198
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,679
you know I just want him to be well.

199
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,999
He has a fever

200
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,000
and a sore throat.

201
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,760
Though it seems like you've fallen
into a trap of your own making.

202
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:41,000
What trap?

203
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,159
Well, don't you feel like

204
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,360
you're

205
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,159
overcorrecting a bit?

206
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,599
You don't understand.

207
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,600
What don't I understand?

208
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:51,679
A secret crush

209
00:10:52,519 --> 00:10:53,519
is like

210
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,240
walking a tightrope

211
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,639
over a cliff.

212
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:58,758
Every step has to be taken with caution,

213
00:10:58,759 --> 00:10:59,960
like walking on thin ice.

214
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,160
You want to be good to him,

215
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,119
yet you don't dare to,

216
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,918
and you don't even know how.

217
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:05,999
But have you ever thought that

218
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,878
you're actually just blowing
things out of proportion?

219
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:09,240
To everyone else, it's just

220
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:13,039
perfectly normal, everyday socializing.

221
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,240
Is that really it?

222
00:11:20,399 --> 00:11:22,120
If you're really that scared,

223
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,440
just use me as a benchmark.

224
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:27,000
Say, back at the casino last time,

225
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,000
if I was the one trying to win,

226
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,799
would you have helped me?

227
00:11:32,919 --> 00:11:33,919
I would.

228
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,480
And the time before that,

229
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,120
if it were me

230
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:39,440
at Eagle Pool

231
00:11:39,559 --> 00:11:40,559
running into trouble,

232
00:11:40,639 --> 00:11:41,919
would you have covered for me?

233
00:11:43,399 --> 00:11:44,200
Of course I would.

234
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,360
And even earlier,

235
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,720
when we had dinner together,

236
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,855
if I'd left my cigarette case

237
00:11:47,879 --> 00:11:48,879
at the hotel,

238
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:51,600
would you have hand-delivered it to me?

239
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,240
Yes.

240
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:53,759
So, do you have a thing for me?

241
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:56,639
Exactly.

242
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,720
What's the big deal?

243
00:11:58,919 --> 00:12:01,120
Now that you put it that way...

244
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,039
Wan,

245
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:07,158
you're so self-conscious and cautious,

246
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:08,239
holding back on everything.

247
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,919
But in everyone else's eyes,

248
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,480
it's just the most basic social etiquette.

249
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:15,839
Not a single thing you do

250
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,360
crosses the line of just being friends.

251
00:12:18,759 --> 00:12:19,839
If you hadn't told me,

252
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,400
I never would've guessed you liked him.

253
00:12:21,639 --> 00:12:23,519
That's how secret crushes are.

254
00:12:23,759 --> 00:12:25,080
The more natural you act,

255
00:12:25,159 --> 00:12:26,519
the better you hide it.

256
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:30,000
The more natural I act,

257
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,319
the better I hide it.

258
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,720
If you're still unsure,

259
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:35,678
just think of a regular friend.

260
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,679
For instance,

261
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,200
Tan Youming.

262
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,919
If he were sick

263
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,440
and home alone,

264
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,798
and you happened to be out,

265
00:12:42,799 --> 00:12:45,279
wouldn't you ask if he needed
you to drop off some medicine?

266
00:12:46,399 --> 00:12:47,840
It's totally normal.

267
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,720
Not asking

268
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:50,759
wouldn't be like you at all.

269
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,320
It wouldn't be Chen Wan.

270
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,480
Right.

271
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:59,000
Even for a regular business partner,

272
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,960
I'd ask out of sheer courtesy.

273
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,240
Just to be polite.

274
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,840
Yet with Zhao Shengge,

275
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:07,200
I'm treating him worse
than a regular friend.

276
00:13:11,399 --> 00:13:12,200
Exactly.

277
00:13:12,399 --> 00:13:13,919
You've got it all backward.

278
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,960
Think it over.

279
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,680
What brings you up to the roof?

280
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:50,120
The files you sent me last night,

281
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,600
I've checked them all.

282
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,720
I don't have any notes.

283
00:13:56,279 --> 00:13:57,480
Just send them out as is.

284
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,320
It's so thorough.

285
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,880
Did you not sleep last night?

286
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,240
I did.

287
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,360
Mr. Zhao,

288
00:14:11,399 --> 00:14:12,439
are you feeling any better today?

289
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,440
If it's convenient for you,

290
00:14:13,441 --> 00:14:14,758
I can come to Minglong to walk you through

291
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:16,200
Dr. Fang's data model.

292
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:17,519
Okay.

293
00:14:17,679 --> 00:14:19,039
You're welcome to come by anytime.

294
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,999
Regarding the West Second Line
environmental project plan from last week,

295
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,599
I also discussed it with Dr. Fang.

296
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,638
We think Plan B is more feasible.

297
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,519
Since you're not feeling well,

298
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:30,800
you shouldn't work for too long.

299
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,920
I've prepared a simplified
version of the report.

300
00:14:35,279 --> 00:14:36,798
Let's find time to get together.

301
00:14:36,799 --> 00:14:38,360
Invite Zhuo Zhixuan and Chen Wan.

302
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,240
What's up?

303
00:14:53,679 --> 00:14:54,679
Enjoy.

304
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:08,720
Mr. Zhao,

305
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:10,120
is your driver back to work yet?

306
00:15:10,639 --> 00:15:11,878
If not,

307
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:12,840
I happen to have

308
00:15:12,841 --> 00:15:14,721
an errand at the stock
exchange this afternoon.

309
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:16,399
Why don't you use my car?

310
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:18,960
How does that sound?

311
00:15:21,679 --> 00:15:22,679
I don't know.

312
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,439
I just feel like some things

313
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,679
are different from before.

314
00:15:32,159 --> 00:15:32,799
No need.

315
00:15:32,799 --> 00:15:33,799
Thank you.

316
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,600
Why don't

317
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,918
I go to Tan Youming for you

318
00:15:38,919 --> 00:15:39,919
and test the waters?

319
00:15:42,039 --> 00:15:43,039
No need.

320
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,679
We can't just keep going like this.

321
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:46,360
Just do what he said earlier

322
00:15:46,679 --> 00:15:48,119
and treat him like a regular friend.

323
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,960
Think about how you'd treat a friend.

324
00:15:51,559 --> 00:15:53,559
A regular friend...

325
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:55,720
Xuan,

326
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,000
you're brilliant.

327
00:16:02,519 --> 00:16:02,879
Hello,

328
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:03,720
Mr. Tan.

329
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:04,440
Hey, Wan.

330
00:16:04,879 --> 00:16:05,879
Your call couldn't have
come at a better time.

331
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:07,040
I was just about to call you.

332
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,600
You go first, then.

333
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,360
It's nothing major.

334
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:11,839
Just wanted to ask if you know
any good places to hang out.

335
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:12,840
What a coincidence.

336
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,199
I was also looking for a chance

337
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,440
to get everyone together.

338
00:16:15,759 --> 00:16:16,839
You mentioned before

339
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,999
that you wanted to go bowling.

340
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,240
Are you still up for it?

341
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:20,518
I know that next week,

342
00:16:20,519 --> 00:16:22,638
a new bowling alley is opening up.

343
00:16:22,639 --> 00:16:24,240
Why don't we go check it out together?

344
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,758
Wan, since this is the
first time you're organizing,

345
00:16:26,759 --> 00:16:27,759
of course we're going.

346
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,240
I'll help you set it up.

347
00:16:30,519 --> 00:16:31,000
Great.

348
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,480
Thanks for the trouble, Mr. Tan.

349
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,600
Piece of cake.

350
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,240
Sir, the lanes you reserved,

351
00:16:38,241 --> 00:16:39,678
lanes three through seven,

352
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:40,559
are all ready for you.

353
00:16:40,559 --> 00:16:41,320
Please sign here.

354
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,440
Okay, thanks.

355
00:16:42,919 --> 00:16:44,158
Back when I approached them,

356
00:16:44,159 --> 00:16:45,279
they gave me the runaround.

357
00:16:46,039 --> 00:16:47,678
Now they're chasing after
me to sign the contract.

358
00:16:47,679 --> 00:16:48,679
Forget it.

359
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,960
Mr. Zhao.

360
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,200
Don't bring it up to me again.

361
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:07,359
Mr. Zhao,

362
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:09,279
do you need a hand?

363
00:17:09,799 --> 00:17:10,799
No need.

364
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,279
Go ahead and join the others.

365
00:17:12,559 --> 00:17:13,559
I'll lock up in a bit.

366
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:15,240
It's fine.

367
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,000
I'll wait so we can head over together.

368
00:17:21,279 --> 00:17:22,279
Mr. Zhao,

369
00:17:22,559 --> 00:17:23,599
is your cold any better?

370
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:24,880
I think it's gone.

371
00:17:28,279 --> 00:17:29,200
Your voice

372
00:17:29,201 --> 00:17:30,216
still sounds a little hoarse.

373
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,640
Would you like some honey water?

374
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,880
I'm fine.

375
00:17:34,119 --> 00:17:35,119
It won't be too sweet,

376
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:38,879
and it's soothing for your throat.

377
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,598
I'll have them make some.

378
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:45,599
It'll just take a second.

379
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,160
Whatever.

380
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,200
Thanks.

381
00:17:52,039 --> 00:17:53,239
Are you guys talking business?

382
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:55,240
I'll head back out.

383
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:04,960
Hold on.

384
00:18:05,359 --> 00:18:06,359
The AC is freezing.

385
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,735
Be careful not to catch a chill.

386
00:18:08,759 --> 00:18:09,319
Wan,

387
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,000
could you help me open my locker?

388
00:18:11,599 --> 00:18:13,319
It's jammed, and my phone is locked inside.

389
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,720
Sure.

390
00:18:23,799 --> 00:18:24,920
Leave it to you, Wan.

391
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:27,038
It happened to me once before,

392
00:18:27,039 --> 00:18:28,519
so I knew how to reset the code.

393
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:29,960
I'll get out of your hair.

394
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,000
I need to go ask the
front desk for something.

395
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:39,839
Okay.

396
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:40,680
Lane five.

397
00:18:40,759 --> 00:18:41,759
Strike!

398
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,480
Told you

399
00:18:42,481 --> 00:18:43,720
I got my touch back!

400
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,160
Nice!

401
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:47,880
Mr. Zhao,

402
00:18:48,119 --> 00:18:49,119
aren't you going to play?

403
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,600
I'll just sit here for a bit.

404
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,240
Go ahead if you want to play.

405
00:18:52,519 --> 00:18:52,880
Four.

406
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,160
I'm not very good at it.

407
00:18:54,359 --> 00:18:55,319
I'm fine just sitting here.

408
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:55,920
Nine.

409
00:18:56,079 --> 00:18:57,079
Ten.

410
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,160
Hey.

411
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,200
Nian.

412
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,200
I looked them over.

413
00:19:08,559 --> 00:19:09,959
The numbers in the
other two reports are off.

414
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,400
All you ever do is work.

415
00:19:13,039 --> 00:19:13,559
Zhixuan.

416
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:14,640
You're up.

417
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:16,279
Remaining pins.

418
00:19:16,279 --> 00:19:16,599
Four,

419
00:19:16,599 --> 00:19:17,000
five,

420
00:19:17,359 --> 00:19:18,359
seven.

421
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,480
The pins are split

422
00:19:20,481 --> 00:19:21,558
right down the middle.

423
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,559
That's a tough shot.

424
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:25,240
Mr. Zhao.

425
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,240
Are you interested?

426
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,480
A little.

427
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:28,759
Nothing more than that.

428
00:19:29,599 --> 00:19:31,519
Who knows if it'll pan out the way I want?

429
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:42,759
Outside.

430
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:43,680
Zhixuan.

431
00:19:43,681 --> 00:19:45,079
Can you make it?

432
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:47,519
Anyone else might miss.

433
00:19:48,039 --> 00:19:49,039
But Mr. Zhao

434
00:19:49,839 --> 00:19:50,839
definitely can.

435
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:52,960
Shengge.

436
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,160
We're counting on you.

437
00:19:56,559 --> 00:19:57,559
Really?

438
00:20:00,359 --> 00:20:01,359
Yes.

439
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,680
Shengge.

440
00:20:16,079 --> 00:20:17,439
How did you pull that off?

441
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:18,000
Excuse me.

442
00:20:18,279 --> 00:20:19,279
With my brain, I suppose.

443
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,719
Pretty impressive.

444
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:22,799
Spare!

445
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,518
Player's individual score

446
00:20:24,519 --> 00:20:26,160
updated to 330 points.

447
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,200
Mr. Zhao.

448
00:20:28,319 --> 00:20:30,359
Would you like another
glass of honey water?

449
00:20:31,079 --> 00:20:32,118
Wan.

450
00:20:32,119 --> 00:20:33,679
I'm dying of thirst here.

451
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:35,399
I don't see you pouring me a glass.

452
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,599
Did you even play

453
00:20:36,799 --> 00:20:37,559
to deserve water?

454
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:38,559
Why, you...

455
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:40,880
Waiter.

456
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,479
Just get me anything cold.

457
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:42,880
Right away.

458
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:44,200
Hold on.

459
00:20:45,119 --> 00:20:46,119
Mr. Zhao.

460
00:20:46,759 --> 00:20:49,239
Iced drinks aren't good
for you right after a workout.

461
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,976
Let me make you another
glass of honey water instead.

462
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:51,640
No need.

463
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:52,880
I'll just have that.

464
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:55,880
How about tea?

465
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:56,839
Will Da Hong Pao do?

466
00:20:56,839 --> 00:20:57,519
Chen Wan.

467
00:20:57,839 --> 00:20:59,719
I stopped drinking Da
Hong Pao a long time ago.

468
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:01,038
What would you like, then?

469
00:21:01,039 --> 00:21:02,279
I'll have them brew it for you.

470
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,680
Taiping Houkui.

471
00:21:08,079 --> 00:21:09,079
Okay.

472
00:21:22,519 --> 00:21:23,519
Strike!

473
00:21:23,559 --> 00:21:25,199
Congratulations to the player on Lane 4

474
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,200
for bowling a turkey!

475
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:28,680
Individual score updated to 300 points.

476
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:29,519
I'm done.

477
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:30,519
With a score like that,

478
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:31,680
I'll never catch up.

479
00:21:31,839 --> 00:21:32,519
Shengge.

480
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:33,119
What do you say?

481
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,680
I'm good to go.

482
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:36,920
Let's keep going, then.

483
00:21:41,359 --> 00:21:42,359
Let me wipe my sweat.

484
00:21:43,519 --> 00:21:44,519
Mr. Zhao.

485
00:21:44,559 --> 00:21:45,758
It fell on the floor. It's dirty.

486
00:21:45,759 --> 00:21:46,759
Use mine.

487
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:57,680
Strike!

488
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,519
Thanks.

489
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:03,720
Shengge.

490
00:22:03,839 --> 00:22:04,839
You're up.

491
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:05,400
Okay.

492
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:05,960
Shengge.

493
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:07,079
You got this.

494
00:22:12,519 --> 00:22:13,519
Strike!

495
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:15,038
Two bonus rolls awarded.

496
00:22:15,039 --> 00:22:16,039
Excuse me, sir.

497
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,039
Looking for me?

498
00:22:17,039 --> 00:22:17,480
Yes.

499
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,359
What is it?

500
00:22:18,360 --> 00:22:19,838
We're running a promotion right now.

501
00:22:19,839 --> 00:22:22,639
Take a photo at our venue,

502
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:23,960
and you'll get a free gift.

503
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:25,160
I'll add you on WeChat later

504
00:22:25,161 --> 00:22:26,361
and have the gift sent to you.

505
00:22:31,319 --> 00:22:33,118
Sure, I'll add you on WeChat later

506
00:22:33,119 --> 00:22:34,119
and send it to you.

507
00:22:34,599 --> 00:22:35,599
Great.

508
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:48,119
Remaining pins.

509
00:22:48,119 --> 00:22:48,880
Remaining pins.

510
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:49,400
Two,

511
00:22:49,599 --> 00:22:50,079
seven,

512
00:22:50,279 --> 00:22:50,720
ten.

513
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:52,999
A 2-7-10 split.

514
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,239
That's even tougher than

515
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:55,920
the 4-6-7-10 earlier.

516
00:22:56,359 --> 00:22:57,359
Mr. Zhao.

517
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:58,680
What happened?

518
00:22:59,799 --> 00:23:00,839
My wrist guard came loose.

519
00:23:01,039 --> 00:23:02,039
Let me help you.

520
00:23:06,200 --> 00:23:06,839
Mr. Zhao.

521
00:23:06,840 --> 00:23:08,599
You could even pick up a Big Four.

522
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:10,696
How could you make a
rookie mistake like this?

523
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:12,400
Looks like you're losing to me today.

524
00:23:13,279 --> 00:23:14,839
A 2-7-10 split.

525
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,240
How do you even pick that up?

526
00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:18,399
In high-tier rounds, you
can't pick up your own split.

527
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,680
You have to nominate a teammate.

528
00:23:20,079 --> 00:23:21,318
In our group,

529
00:23:21,319 --> 00:23:22,319
besides Shengge,

530
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:23,495
who else can make that shot?

531
00:23:23,519 --> 00:23:25,255
Why don't you find someone
to pick up the spare for you?

532
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:26,480
Nian, can you do it?

533
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,000
If no one can make it, forget it.

534
00:23:28,039 --> 00:23:29,440
Whatever. Wrap it up.

535
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,160
Alright then.

536
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:32,440
Wait a second.

537
00:23:34,599 --> 00:23:35,599
Mr. Zhao.

538
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:38,440
May I give it a shot?

539
00:23:40,279 --> 00:23:41,279
Wan.

540
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,919
You barely played at all tonight.

541
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:44,440
I thought you weren't into it.

542
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:47,719
Nice one, Chen Wan.

543
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:48,880
Hiding your skills, huh?

544
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:50,160
Mr. Zhao.

545
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,720
May I give it a try?

546
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:59,160
I don't think I'll lose.

547
00:24:05,519 --> 00:24:06,079
Sir.

548
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:07,240
Here is your tea.

549
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:11,920
Thank you.

550
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:40,318
Congratulations on converting the split!

551
00:24:40,319 --> 00:24:42,559
Individual score updated to 400 points.

552
00:24:43,279 --> 00:24:44,279
A Christmas tree split.

553
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,440
Amazing.

554
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,640
Shengge, that's cheating!

555
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:50,000
Complain all you want.

556
00:24:52,759 --> 00:24:53,759
Mr. Zhao.

557
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,160
We won.

558
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,240
Thank you.

559
00:24:59,519 --> 00:25:00,519
Chen Wan.

560
00:25:01,839 --> 00:25:02,400
My pleasure.

561
00:25:02,839 --> 00:25:04,719
A split that doesn't even show
up once in a hundred games,

562
00:25:04,720 --> 00:25:05,880
and you actually ran into it.

563
00:25:07,559 --> 00:25:08,559
Just lucky.

564
00:25:21,119 --> 00:25:22,119
Mr. Zhao.

565
00:25:23,319 --> 00:25:24,319
Chen Wan.

566
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:25,400
Do you often hit

567
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:27,880
the Christmas tree split?

568
00:25:28,559 --> 00:25:29,079
No.

569
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,240
First time.

570
00:25:30,519 --> 00:25:31,519
Really?

571
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:33,120
It's my first time getting one, too.

572
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:35,200
Then the honor is mine.

573
00:25:35,599 --> 00:25:36,919
